@startuml 03_components
title Component Diagram (draft): PKB Semantic Search

package "Frontend" {
  [React App\n(search UI, strategy comparison)] as ReactApp
}

package "Backend services" {
  [Search API\nFastAPI :8002] as SearchAPI
  [Notes API\nFastAPI :8001] as NotesAPI
  [Embedding Service\nFastAPI :8003] as EmbSvc
  [Evaluation Module\n(Python script / service)] as Eval
}

database "PostgreSQL 16 + pgvector" as DB {
  [notes, chunks]
  [embeddings\n(HNSW / IVFFlat index)]
  [labeled queries]
}

cloud "Embedding model\n(sentence-transformers)" as Model

ReactApp --> SearchAPI : HTTP/JSON\nsearch, compare
ReactApp --> NotesAPI : HTTP/JSON\nnote CRUD
SearchAPI --> DB : sparse (FTS/BM25),\ndense (pgvector), RRF
SearchAPI --> EmbSvc : query embedding
NotesAPI --> DB : store notes
NotesAPI --> EmbSvc : chunk embeddings\non create/update
EmbSvc --> Model : encode text
EmbSvc --> DB : store vectors
Eval --> SearchAPI : run queries\nper strategy
Eval --> DB : read labeled queries
@enduml
